@UnitConversion.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7240

### Convert length
POST {{UnitConversion.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/conversions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 10,
  "fromUnit": "meter",
  "toUnit": "feet"
}

### List all units
GET {{UnitConversion.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/units

### Units by category
GET {{UnitConversion.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/units/Temperature